  "content": "\n\n<h1>Better Bundles</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/better-bundles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/509980.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-bundles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_509980_downloads.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbetterbundles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/betterbundles?color=00AF5C&label=modrinth&style=flat&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"\"></a>  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.gnu.org%252flicenses%252flgpl-3.0\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-LGPL v3-blue.svg\" alt=\"License: LGPL v3\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fbetter-bundles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/better-bundles/localized.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmaven.paube.de%252freleases%252fde%252fcheaterpaul%252fbetterbundles%252fBetterBundles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badgen.net/maven/v/metadata-url/https/maven.paube.de/releases/de/cheaterpaul/betterbundles/BetterBundles/maven-metadata.xml\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h2>Описание мода</h2>\n<h3>Красящийся мешок</h3>\n<p>Стандартный мешок можно окрашивать любым красителем\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cJn3dMn/dye-bundles.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>Улучшенные мешки</h3>\n<p>Стандартный мешок можно улучшить.</p>\n<p>Хотя мешки более высокого уровня вместительнее, незеритовый мешок просто делает его огнестойким.\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gPQ73YK/better-bundles.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h5>Рецепты</h5>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VNk6PTG/copper-bundle-recipe-2.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/z528y00/copper-iron-bundle-recipe-2.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/b1XPmrV/iron-bundle-recipe-2.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2ZVv6DL/silver-bundle-recipe-2.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5ky7bSW/silver-gold-bundle-recipe-2.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qBLKXKP/gold-bundle-recipe-2.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/J2TLWdY/diamond-bundle-recipe-2.png\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/n17kdBT/netherite-bundle-recipe-2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>Ссылки</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-bundles\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a> Скачать<br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fbetter-bundles\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a> Перевести мод<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Cheaterpaul/BetterBundles\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a> исходный код</p>\n<h2>Лицензия</h2>\n<p>Этот мод распространяется под лицензией <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fCheaterpaul%252fBetterBundle%252f1.17%252fLICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">LGPLv3</a></p>",
